{"h":3390,"lines":[{"x":0.0082135492068117818,"y":0.0058139530575510578,"w":0.30390144348144532,"h":0.033430233395556841,"t":"@MirsIELTS","c":1},{"h":0.015937881694782385,"c":1,"t":"Test 2","x":0.84773327046823133,"y":0.045810128896460078,"w":0.062233664194742855},{"t":"COLEMAN:","c":1,"x":0.073921970378826959,"y":0.095930232542154381,"w":0.071868584950764966,"h":0.0087209302063888661},{"y":0.12586069030057268,"x":0.071655916266681843,"c":1,"h":0.012813502849027492,"w":0.062026977539062486,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"x":0.073921970258643346,"h":0.008720930206388755,"c":1,"w":0.071868584950764966,"y":0.1424418604653761,"t":"COLEMAN:"},{"h":0.010174418761666804,"c":1,"w":0.061601645151774104,"x":0.07186858184243769,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.18895348827604308},{"w":0.069815190633138027,"x":0.075975362229632207,"t":"COLEMAN:","y":0.20348837234021377,"h":0.011627906191665538,"c":1},{"x":0.071868581838897369,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.061601645151774062,"y":0.2354651161823933,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1},{"y":0.09292035371670071,"w":0.62217661539713542,"t":"That's the last ten minutes of the lesson, when we pick out the individual notes","h":0.014749262536873253,"c":1,"x":0.16837781135102281},{"x":0.17043121147135784,"w":0.40246406555175773,"h":0.013112266225449143,"c":1,"y":0.10901162764180472,"t":"from a tune he's made up. It's always quite simple."},{"y":0.12499999973183118,"w":0.21560574849446618,"t":"That must be hard, though.","h":0.013081395872223012,"c":1,"x":0.17043121189036425},{"c":1,"y":0.13735484750517468,"w":0.64088663736979168,"x":0.16828413633636596,"t":"It is, but people like it because they can really concentrate and if we're all playing","h":0.020048977562108217},{"x":0.168311825150332,"y":0.15337984027869112,"w":0.63874053955078125,"h":0.01824483168160318,"t":"well, it sounds quite impressive. The only trouble is that he sometimes gets us to","c":1},{"x":0.17248459612478664,"y":0.17138643073693105,"w":0.29568789164225262,"c":1,"t":"play one at a time - you know, alone.","h":0.013274336283185861},{"w":0.10113245010375979,"h":0.014087311286138604,"c":1,"t":"That's scary.","x":0.17020634020515737,"y":0.18605286412224475},{"h":0.018273241611356905,"c":1,"t":"It is, but l've got used to it now. At the end he spends about five minutes telling us","x":0.16830378718043229,"w":0.64697942097981775,"y":0.19968243144440845},{"w":0.31006159464518229,"t":"what to practise for the following week.","h":0.011799410029498469,"c":1,"x":0.17043121490517932,"y":0.21799410021207288},{"w":0.54426508585611977,"h":0.018978841325878015,"t":"Well, thanks Coleman. I'll go and have a look at that website, I think.","c":1,"x":0.16831870152409484,"y":0.23097916640917893},{"w":0.039014374415079711,"y":0.17005813966348859,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"t":"Q10","x":0.83778234047897626},{"x":0.07384650387229845,"h":0.015089972391944317,"t":"PART 2","y":0.28315268820771489,"c":1,"w":0.10487372716267902},{"c":1,"y":0.30912011532146644,"h":0.016795762098644418,"w":0.70238784790039055,"t":"I never really planned to be a lifeboat volunteer when I came to live in Northsea. I'd been","x":0.071803634237577824},{"c":1,"w":0.71689147949218746,"h":0.021286994236408674,"t":"working in London as a website designer, but although that was interesting, I didn't like city","x":0.073799374450656402,"y":0.32356264511760569},{"y":0.34032143757514743,"c":1,"w":0.70439280192057296,"x":0.071825672640905697,"h":0.017307983668504501,"t":"life. I'd been really keen on boats as a teenager, and I thought if I went to live by the sea,"},{"w":0.67772420247395837,"h":0.016197458902994732,"y":0.35580739242149795,"x":0.073875649612398883,"t":"I might be able to pursue that interest a bit more in my free time. Then I found that the","c":1},{"y":0.37174873248160534,"w":0.53606674194335946,"c":1,"t":"Lifeboat Institution was looking for volunteers, so I decided to apply.","h":0.017558703802328157,"x":0.073853835773325757},{"t":"The Lifeboat Institution building here in Northsea's hard to miss, it's one of the largest in the","h":0.019540213975934417,"w":0.72297576904296867,"x":0.073842455629792497,"c":1,"y":0.39371666555162355},{"h":0.016749282431813506,"w":0.71262908935546876,"c":1,"t":"country. It was built 15 years ago with funds provided by a generous member of the public","x":0.07385991010941817,"y":0.40982088785892723},{"y":0.42584537444591652,"t":"who'd lived here all her life. As the Lifeboat Institution is a charity that relies on that kind of","w":0.71471023559570312,"h":0.015897492040223393,"x":0.071810170120688965,"c":1},{"w":0.68182515462239579,"h":0.016812586151393139,"t":"donation, rather than funding provided by the government, that was a huge help to us.","c":1,"y":0.44124227946681571,"x":0.07386688517599041},{"t":"When I applied, I had to have a health assessment. The doctors were particularly interested","w":0.72484598795572919,"y":0.46511627918484666,"x":0.073921975136904627,"h":0.016004664778357824,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395872223012,"c":1,"x":0.073921980514014551,"t":"in my vision. I used to be short-sighted, so I'd had to wear glasses, but I'd had laser eye","y":0.48110465089830268,"w":0.694045155843099},{"t":"surgery two years earlier so that was OK. They gave me tests for colour blindness and they","c":1,"w":0.71878362019856767,"h":0.015324961119345115,"y":0.49509817349919094,"x":0.075925761287178192},{"x":0.073833263601682741,"t":"thought I might have a problem there, but it turned out I was OK.","y":0.51083860906052847,"h":0.018087388210240363,"c":1,"w":0.51351633707682287},{"w":0.71879180908203122,"y":0.53434225602734242,"t":"When the coastguard gets an alert, all the volunteers are contacted and rush to the lifeboat","x":0.075927023591517387,"h":0.014403695975784725,"c":1},{"y":0.55073746311118188,"w":0.72073923746744795,"t":"station. Our target's to get there in five minutes, then we try to get the boat off the dock and","h":0.014749262536873142,"x":0.073921962296829333,"c":1},{"y":0.56540697647734306,"t":"out to sea in another six to eight minutes. Our team's proud that we usually achieve that - the","w":0.73716634114583324,"h":0.013081395872222901,"c":1,"x":0.07597535105960769},{"t":"I've recently qualified as what's called a 'helmsman', which means I have the ultimate","c":1,"w":0.67556467692057287,"x":0.073921973603852817,"y":0.60465116290468868,"h":0.015997804512316471},{"t":"responsibility for the lifeboat. I have to check that the equipment we use is in working order -","h":0.014534883302221635,"y":0.62063953509073089,"x":0.073921981807487408,"w":0.73511291503906251,"c":1},{"x":0.075922067466743126,"w":0.66952779134114582,"t":"the crew have special life jackets that can support up to four people in the water. And","y":0.63475455923680024,"h":0.015129071350997836,"c":1},{"w":0.72895273844401043,"c":1,"t":"it's ultimately my decision whether it's safe to launch the boat. But it's very rare not to launch","h":0.016072408850565711,"y":0.64970930231010671,"x":0.073921990754038616},{"y":0.66860465089515164,"w":0.23203285217285152,"c":1,"t":"it, even in the worst weather.","h":0.01310626342233312,"x":0.073921972165394298},{"x":0.073921967135453834,"w":0.67351130167643236,"t":"As well as going out on the lifeboat, my work involves other things too. A lot of people","c":1,"h":0.014749262536873142,"y":0.69026548656621733},{"c":1,"t":"underestimate how quickly conditions can change at sea, so I speak to youth groups and","w":0.70030293782552078,"h":0.015607054606299742,"x":0.075935660182469611,"y":0.70492281396356149},{"w":0.7146937561035156,"c":1,"x":0.073866154787186819,"y":0.7200479315586541,"t":"sailing clubs in the area about the sorts of problems that sailors and swimmers can have if","h":0.015542549650929383},{"c":1,"y":0.73687315660177255,"h":0.013126843657817133,"w":0.71252568562825525,"t":"the weather suddenly gets bad. We also have a lot of volunteers who organise activities to","x":0.075975350110266793},{"x":0.075975361298657687,"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"raise money for us, and we couldn't manage without them.","y":0.75280235981249477,"w":0.46406570434570316,"c":1},{"t":"Q11","w":0.036960986455281564,"x":0.83778234035209909,"y":0.34011627932710953,"h":0.013081394746943698,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q12","x":0.83778234035129384,"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943698,"y":0.40988372119270466},{"y":0.49709302339324335,"t":"Q13","w":0.036960983276367099,"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.83778234224271997,"c":1},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q14","x":0.83778234228232806,"y":0.54941860478859217,"w":0.039014371236165357,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q15","x":0.83866034216795182,"y":0.65046107571855383,"w":0.041379308700561501,"h":0.016058602797246579},{"x":0.84188911651991327,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1,"t":"Q16","y":0.70494186072758847,"w":0.036960986455281564},{"w":0.69621744791666673,"t":"The training we get is a continuous process, focusing on technical competence and safe","x":0.075924569836016073,"h":0.015916500260344635,"c":1,"y":0.79500605616438647},{"w":0.735296885172526,"y":0.80969903256849307,"x":0.073827492801146283,"h":0.018202382765688419,"t":"handling techniques, and it's given me the confidence to deal with extreme situations without","c":1},{"x":0.075975350487892307,"c":1,"w":0.72073923746744795,"h":0.016032962742808299,"t":"panicking. I was glad I'd done a first aid course before I started, as that's a big help with the","y":0.82703488383339785},{"y":0.84302325554939195,"w":0.70225870768229171,"t":"casualty care activities we do. We've done a lot on how to deal with ropes and tie knots -","x":0.078028756980569658,"c":1,"h":0.013081395872223012},{"x":0.075943255204016208,"t":"that's an essential skill. After a year, I did a one-week residential course, led by specialists.","w":0.71464853922526039,"y":0.85747566543875831,"h":0.015891954540151354,"c":1},{"y":0.87262715673383617,"h":0.01553300221761067,"x":0.077988174097986585,"c":1,"w":0.73725621541341146,"t":"They had a wave-tank where they could create extreme weather conditions - so we could get"},{"x":0.07392196586916451,"h":0.013119983954415604,"y":0.8895348834559994,"w":0.63244354248046875,"c":1,"t":"experience at what to do if the boat turned over in a storm at night, for example."},{"t":"Q17\/18","y":0.87209302353253604,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.063655033111572279,"x":0.83983572770233228},{"c":1,"t":"105","x":0.87063654985611516,"y":0.92151162816944876,"h":0.013081394746943587,"w":0.039014374415079711},{"x":0.51176470218665204,"w":0.45294118245442705,"c":1,"y":0.94166666659226195,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.04166666666666663}],"w":2400}